  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Rockman No Constancy is a complete romhack of Rockman 2.\r\n\r\nModifications include completely new soundtrack, new graphics, altered bosses/weapons, and completely new level layouts.\r\n\r\nv1.0 (21 October 2007) Initial release:\r\n\r\nNORMAL mode can be satisfactorily cleared even without a save states.\r\n\r\nHARD mode specifications:\r\n-Attack power/Half Defense power, or 3/4 (Damage fraction up)\r\n-Life recovery amount 10 → 8; Life recovery small amount 2 → 1\r\n-Shocked only during unbeatable time knockback after hit (110 frames to 32 frames)\r\n-Change Rockman&#039;s body color and title color\r\n-Heatman&#039;s weapon has improved energy efficiency to 1 due to operational reasons\r\n ----\r\n\r\nUPDATE: v1.2 (2018/04/13)\r\n-Mainly cosmetic changes\r\n-Player sprite designed to look like Rockman X\r\n-Got weapon and ending image of Rockman changed\r\n-Got weapon image of Roll changed\r\n ----\r\n\r\nUPDATE: v1.3 (2019/01/21)\r\n-Hard mode addition\r\n-Adjustment of special weapon versus enemy damage\r\n-Partial special weapon pallet change\r\n-Expand grace time for blue charge shot (increase in power) of Proto Charge\r\n-Change the body judgment of the Rumbling Bomb so that the ball trajectory moves slightly forward\r\n-Extend Flashman&#039;s Time Stopper usage interval\r\n-Increase Woodman&#039;s weak point damage from 6 to 8\r\n-Changing the Rumbling Bomb to touch the Mecha Dragon&#039;s scaffold\r\n-Normal version only Decrease the judgment of the Wily Machine bullet accordingly\r\n-Only the normal version relaxed the high difficulty part of the stage changed\r\n\r\nHard mode specification\r\n-Body color change of Rockman\r\n-Reduce invincible time in half\r\n-Double the enemy&#039;s overall durability by a factor of twice (special weapons versus enemy only available)\r\n-Excluding some of the attack power of the boss 1.5-fold rise\r\n-Life restoration small recovery amount 2 → 1 life; weapon recovery large recovery amount 10 → 8\r\n-Increase the initial remaining lives to 5"
    }
  ],
